      "created_at": "2016-01-26T18:40:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't have Vengeance or Villains yet, but I'm curious -- things like Take Down and Infrared Eyepiece say to stop or look at \"the Villain deck.\" In Vengeance, does this apply to <em>all</em> of the villain decks? And doesn't this make things like Mistbound or Turmoil a lot less effective by comparison?</p>",
