      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-26T18:51:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You choose only one villain deck for anything that targets multiples. &nbsp;It does make Turmoil, Mistbound, and Takedown less useful, but they were crazy powerful before.</p>",
