      "created_at": "2016-01-28T14:03:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That can't be right - Infection targets a \"hero\" and you can decide which Sentinel to put it on when it gets played on them. If \"hero\" means \"hero character card\" that doesn't work for the Sentinels - they've always been one hero with four character cards...</p>",
